  "id": "synergistic-muscles",
  "term": "synergistic muscles",
  "definition": "Synergistic muscles are muscles within the same muscle group that act together to produce force or movement. The packet also indicates that even muscles working together in this way can differ in how they are activated as force or joint angle changes.",
